[11.204981, "o", "\r  zoom ×10^ 34.1  [\u001b[31m████████████████████████████████████████████\u001b[2m░░\u001b[0m]  string-scale proposals · 10⁻³³ m — UNVERIFIED   "]
[11.238896, "o", "\r  zoom ×10^ 35.0  [\u001b[31m██████████████████████████████████████████████\u001b[2m\u001b[0m]  PLANCK LENGTH · 10⁻³⁵ m — beyond this, 'smaller' is not a thing   \r\u001b[2K│  \u001b[33mtotal zoom: ×10³³. physics verified at every stop — then the road ends,\r\n"]
[11.238958, "o", "│  \u001b[33mnot with a thing, but with the end of the CONCEPT of size.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L21 · THE EDGE — here be dragons \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  the honest inventory of what 'deeper' cannot currently answer\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.238975, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n│    \u001b[2mno verified theory. strings: 10 extra dims, unproven. LQG: quantized space, unproven.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.31906, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? vacuum catastrophe\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.319126, "o", "│    \u001b[2mQFT predicts empty-space energy 10¹²⁰× observed — worst miss in physics. machine works anyway.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.39614, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? dark sector\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.396202, "o", "│    \u001b[2m~95% of the universe (dark energy ~68% + dark matter ~27%) unmeasured. we are the minority.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.472425, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? measurement problem\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.472487, "o", "│    \u001b[2mL19. unsolved since 1927 — the longest-running spiral in science.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.552483, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[33m? holography / it-from-bit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.552535, "o", "│    \u001b[2mreal math (AdS/CFT): a volume fully encoded on its boundary. proven in toy universes only.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.62991, "o", "│  every previous level answered. this one refuses. the bottom of 'as deep as\r\n"]
[11.629984, "o", "│  we can' is a boundary of knowledge, drawn in 10⁻³⁵ m ink.\r\n\r\n"]
[11.63, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L22 · BELOW THE WALL — the map of the unverified \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.630009, "o", "\u001b[2m│  the last floor: not a place — a stack of hypotheses with no floor yet\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.759428, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ string theory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.759486, "o", "│    \u001b[2meverything = 1D filaments ~10⁻³⁵ m, modes = particles. needs 10 spatial dimensions. no unique experimental test to date. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.85207, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ loop quantum gravity\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.852167, "o", "│    \u001b[2mspace and time themselves quantized; smallest volume ~4×10⁻¹⁰⁵ m³. no confirmed prediction. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.939782, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ causal set theory\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.939844, "o", "│    \u001b[2mspacetime grows from a discrete partial order of events — 'before' is the only primitive. STATUS: UNVERIFIED.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.032442, "o", "│  \u001b[1m\u001b[35m∴ the holographic principle\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.032502, "o", "│    \u001b[2m3D reality fully encoded on a 2D boundary. exact for some toy universes (AdS/CFT); ours: UNKNOWN.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.125068, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.125136, "o", "│  \u001b[1mthis is maximum depth. not because we stopped digging — because the\r\n│  shovel is made of the thing we're digging in.\u001b[0m below the wall there is no\r\n│  'below'. there are proposals, beautifully drawn, none with a floor of their own.\r\n│  \u001b[31mdeepest we can go = a well-posed map of what we cannot reach.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.12516, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n"]
[12.125175, "o", "  FINAL REPORT — THE COMPLETE DESCENT · L0 → L22 · MAXIMUM DEPTH REACHED\r\n  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
